sequenceDiagram
  actor Author
  participant Aurelius
  participant Validator
  participant Publisher
  Author->>Aurelius: Submit Markdown and Mermaid
  activate Aurelius
  Aurelius->>Validator: Check content and diagram contracts
  alt Contracts are valid
    Validator-->>Aurelius: Validation passed
    Aurelius->>Publisher: Build static projections
    Publisher-->>Author: Publish human and agent views
  else Contract violation
    Validator-->>Aurelius: Return actionable error
    Aurelius-->>Author: Point to the invalid source
  end
  deactivate Aurelius

